"Schaddens. Dat is meist as dat Utbleken un niege Utwickeln in en "
"Sepia-Toner.</p>"

#: imageplugins/imageeffect_bwsepia.cpp:322
msgid "Brown Tone"
msgstr "Bruun Klöörtoon"

#: imageplugins/imageeffect_bwsepia.cpp:323
msgid ""
