"<p>This filter is more neutral than Sepia Tone filter.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Swattwitt mit bruun Klöörtoon</b>:"
"<p>Neutraler as de Sepia-Klöörtoonfilter.</p>"

#: imageplugins/imageeffect_bwsepia.cpp:328
msgid "Cold Tone"
msgstr "Koolt Klöörtoon"

#: imageplugins/imageeffect_bwsepia.cpp:329
msgid ""
"<b>Black & White with Cold Tone</b>:"
"<p>Start subtle and replicate printing on a cold tone black and white paper "
"such as a bromide enlarging paper.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Swattwitt mit koolt Klöörtoon</b>:"
