#: utilities/setup/setupmetadata.cpp:161
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p><b>EXIF</b> is a standard used by most digital cameras today to store "
"technical information about the photograph as metadata in the image file. You "
"can learn more about EXIF at <a href='http://www.exif.org'>www.exif.org</a>.</p>"
"<p><b>IPTC</b> is another standard used in digital photography to store "
"embedded information in pictures. You can learn more about IPTC at <a "
"href='http://www.iptc.org/IIM'>www.iptc.org</a>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>EXIF</b> is en Standard, den de mehrsten modernen Kameras bruukt, wenn se "
"technische Informatschonen över dat Bild as Metadaten binnen de Bilddatei "
"sekert. Wenn Du mehr över EXIF weten wullt, kiek op <a "
"href='http://www.exif.org'>http://www.exif.org</a> na.</p>"
"<p><b>IPTC</b> is en anner Standard för de Digitaalfotografie, mit den sik "
"Informatschonen na Biller inbetten laat. Wenn Du mehr över IPTC weten wullt, "
"kiek op <a href='http://www.iptc.org/IIM'>http://www.iptc.org/IIM</a> na.</p>"

